      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Twenty-five patients with joint rheumatoid pain were treated as outpatients during 15 days with 450 mg/day fo proglumetacin. Efficacy was \"good\" or \"very good\" in 64% of the patients. No case of clinically significant side-effects was observed."},
